{
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "strings": {
    "1. 回到主屏幕，长按空白处。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1. 回到主屏幕，长按空白处。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "1. On your Home Screen, touch and hold an empty area."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "2. 点击「编辑」→「添加小组件」。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2. 点击「编辑」→「添加小组件」。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "2. Tap Edit, then Add Widget."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "3. 搜索「小小奇遇」，添加中号小组件。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "3. 搜索「小小奇遇」，添加中号小组件。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "3. Search for TinyStory (小小奇遇 on a Chinese system) and add the medium widget."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上一页": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "上一页"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Previous"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "下一页": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "下一页"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Next page"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不需要登录，也不需要联网。当前不提供云同步，删除 App 后数据可能无法恢复。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不需要登录，也不需要联网。当前不提供云同步，删除 App 后数据可能无法恢复。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No account or internet needed. Cloud sync is not available. Deleting the app may permanently remove your data."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "优先未完成：按目录寻找尚未读完的故事，接着原进度读。按列表顺序：直接进入下一篇。遇到已完成故事会重新开始，已收藏结局保留。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "优先未完成：按目录寻找尚未读完的故事，接着原进度读。按列表顺序：直接进入下一篇。遇到已完成故事会重新开始，已收藏结局保留。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unfinished first: continue the next unfinished story in library order. Library order: go straight to the next story. Completed stories restart, keeping collected endings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关于小小奇遇": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
