    "故事和进度均保存在本机，不需要联网。重新开始会保留已发现结局和历史旅程。当前不提供云同步或备份，删除 App 后数据可能无法恢复。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "故事和进度均保存在本机，不需要联网。重新开始会保留已发现结局和历史旅程。当前不提供云同步或备份，删除 App 后数据可能无法恢复。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Stories and progress stay on your device. No internet is needed. Restarting keeps discovered endings and past journeys. Cloud sync and backups are not available; deleting the app may permanently remove your data."
          }
        }
      }
    },
