    "橙色连接表示走过的选择。未探索节点不显示剧情和结局名称。相同节点可能由不同路线到达。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "橙色连接表示走过的选择。未探索节点不显示剧情和结局名称。相同节点可能由不同路线到达。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Orange links mark choices you have made. Unexplored scenes and ending names stay hidden. Different paths may reach the same scene."
          }
        }
      }
    },
