    "读到结局时自动保存；中途重新开始也会保留已走路径。历史旅程保留当时的正文和选择。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "读到结局时自动保存；中途重新开始也会保留已走路径。历史旅程保留当时的正文和选择。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Completed stories are saved automatically. Restarting also saves your unfinished path. History keeps the text and choices from that run."
